The IBM Z mainframe is widely acknowledged as the most reliable, powerful, secure platform, however the fast-changing technology market makes it necessary to constantly preserve awareness of this vibrant, unique and unprecedented capability. Numerous clients have sought to invest away from the platform, only to reverse the decision at a later date, which has proven costly both to their businesses and to IBM's ability to drive new and innovative engagements. Now, at a time when IBM Z has been designed for trusted digital experiences, it allows us to bring to life the concept of the "incumbent disruptor", and fuel real change in our clients and all of IBM's lines of business.
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        A key element in this mission is the global "Break the Cycle" initiative, setting ambitions to:
                                                                                                                                                                                                        1. Acquire new mainframe clients in emerging industry sectors;
                                                                                                                                                                                                        2. Acquire new mainframe clients in existing industries;
                                                                                                                                                                                                        3. Grow new, strategic mainframe workloads in existing clients.
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        We see this initiative will aid AoT thought leader in their clients engagements, and would call upon the team to lend their insights in this strategic global initiative.

